Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,¿Qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,¡Hermana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,¿Hoshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-chan no está enojada.
