Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-chan, ábrele tu trasero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reika-san, me da vergüenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,¡Mete tu pene dentro de este agujero!
